OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are these #6m council flats
OL,4,Astill standing empty?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Dunstable's First and Last pub was
OL,7,Fdemolished after serving its last pint
OL,8,Fin 2017, people living nearby watched
OL,9,Fas a new four-storey block of flats
OL,10,Fbegan to appear on the site.
OL,12,FAgainst the background of a housing
OL,13,Fshortage, 35 new apartments in Birch
OL,14,FCourt looked like a step forward.
OL,16,FCentral Bedfordshire Council bought the
OL,17,Fblock for #6.25m in 2022, but four
OL,18,Fyears later, it is still empty.
OL,20,FSo, what happened and why?
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
